# PeopleSoft API Configuration -- non-sensitive only
#
# Copy this file to .Renviron.prod or .Renviron.test and fill in actual values.
# NEVER commit real values. Both .Renviron.prod and .Renviron.test are gitignored.
#
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# SECRETS POLICY (CRITICAL):
#
# The following credentials MUST be set as SYSTEM (or USER) environment
# variables on the Windows host running the scheduled task -- NEVER in any
# .Renviron.* file in this repo:
#
#   PSA_API_USERNAME       PeopleSoft API username
#   PSA_API_PROD_PASSWORD  PeopleSoft API password
#   PSA_SQL_USERNAME       SQL Server login (SQL auth)
#   PSA_SQL_PASSWORD       SQL Server password (SQL auth)
#
# Rationale:
#   - .Renviron.* may be edited/copied by ops staff. Secrets at the OS level
#     are protected by Windows ACLs and never appear in repo history.
#   - SQL auth is required because Task Scheduler runs non-interactively;
#     Trusted_Connection = "Yes" fails with NT AUTHORITY\ANONYMOUS LOGON.
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------

PSA_API_BASE_URL=https://<server-name>/apiserver/api.rsc/
PSA_SQL_SERVER=<sql-server-hostname>
PSA_SQL_DATABASE=<database-name>
PSA_PROXY_HOST=<proxy-ip>
PSA_PROXY_PORT=8080